source: synthesized by examples/seed_corpus.rs
captured: no — deliberately synthetic, and expected to stay that way
describes: four levels of interleaved PushClip / PushTransform /
  PushLayer, unwound in mirror order. Each level insets its clip, scales
  slightly, and drops opacity.
models: nothing in particular. This one is not imitating a consumer.
rationale: the translator's stack handling is where consumer-visible
  ordering bugs hide, and real scenes nest shallowly enough that they
  never reach the awkward case. Keep this fixture even once real
  captures land.
